===Noun===
{{en-noun|pl=heathen|pl2=heathens}}

# A person who does not follow an [[Abrahamic]] [[religion]]; a [[pagan]].
# {{by extension}} An uncultured or uncivilized  person.
# Self-designation of some adherents of [[neo-paganism]].

